{
  "name": "project-relative-graph-paths",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-26T18:35:21.115Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-28T08:50:03.642Z",
  "description": "Interprets every path and pattern in specd.yaml relative to the project root across all graph keys and levels, so a pattern always refers to the same file wherever it is evaluated. Workspace-local excludes can no longer override global ones. Adds a graph why command (cli -> sdk -> code-graph ExplainGraphPath) that reports which rule excludes or classifies a path, using the same evaluation functions as the indexer.",
